        "Monday, 3 August 2026",
        "Day 1",
        "",
        "• Added multi-professional career banner above the black strip.\n• Applied Merrakii logo across non-animation pages and at the top of the animation page.",
        "",
        "",
        "• Locked three fixed plans: Starter ₹99, Growth ₹499, Premium ₹999 (removed monthly subscription panel).\n• Simplified checkout fields (removed full name / mobile / email from this step).\n• Added branded payment method tiles (UPI, cards, wallets, net banking).\n• Built UPI Generate QR flow with 30s timer and success popup + View Journey.\n• Added card OTP confirmation screen (MM/YY auto-format).\n• Added net-banking confirmation screen.\n• Removed the intermediate “Verify it’s you” email OTP page.",
