        "Day 2",
        "",
        "• Homepage search now redirects to Deep Profiling first (was: straight to journey/map).",
        "• Wooden trunk markers on every milestone platform.\n• Fixed “Begin your journey” CTA (exit into payment).\n• Removed slide-in free-trial side panel on milestone click.\n• Hover thought-bubble popups on milestones.\n• Character moves with arrow keys and shows bubble on arrival.",
        "• Added confused-student artwork with rising thought-bubble questions.\n• Added four service tiles under the student (Career Counselling, Test Prep, 21st Century Skills, Industry & Mentor Matching).\n• Reduced form to Full name, Phone, Email, Class.\n• Added Get OTP → Proceed mobile OTP gate.\n• Added student logo above the form.\n• Phone field shows flag + country dial code pattern.",
        "• “Begin your journey” on the animation page now opens plans/checkout (replacing the old free-trial panel).",
